# Beast 3.0 Supply Chain & Logistics Division

The Supply Chain & Logistics Division oversees the verifiable tracking, custody transfer, and provenance validation of all physical and digital resources distributed across the Beast 3.0 ecosystem.

## Mission

Ensure transparent, tamper-proof asset accountability from source generation to final deployment or member delivery.

## Core Responsibilities

- Asset Provenance & Lifecycle Tracking
- Custody Chain Verification
- Logistics Dispatch & Shipment Routing
- Integration with Resource Allocation & Treasury

## Connected Systems

- Resource Allocation Division (`div-06-resource-alloc`)
- Treasury & Revenue Division (`beast3-treasury-revenue`)
- Judicial & Audit Division (`div-03-judicial`)

## Status

Development
